prite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1175,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[787,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon, `variant=\"control\"`, and `size` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1684,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1673,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[493,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[537,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1491,"**Tab**"],[181,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[983,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1109,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1431,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1429,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1430,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[938,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1487,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1486,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1688,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1677,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[552,"**Trade-offs:**"],[494,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[314,"**Trigger and calendar**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a calendar icon and the formatted value from the field. `DatePickerCalendar` (and `DateRangePickerCalendar`) is the calendar in the popover it opens: it takes `Calendar` props plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `Calendar` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[1141,"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[703,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[1864,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[488,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1656,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1928,"**Use `Grid` when**: You need explicit two-dimensional layouts with rows and columns, named grid areas, or responsive auto-fill patterns."],[555,"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"],[556,"**Use sprite mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"],[566,"**Use sprite mode**: For repeated icons, consider sprite mode which consolidates multiple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[790,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1145,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1389,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[788,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1706,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1648,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1682,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1657,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[542,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1233,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1230,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1239,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1240,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1228,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1234,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1237,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1231,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1243,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[91,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[1907,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1909,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1903,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[1905,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[1910,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[1906,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[1904,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[1908,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[1860,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[428,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1424,"`align` centers the parts as well as the text, so a `Tag` eyebrow stays centered too."],[989,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1114,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[289,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[184,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[990,"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"],[1115,"`aria-disabled` for disabled segments"],[186,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[992,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1503,"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"],[1116,"`aria-label` required on the container for screen readers"],[288,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[890,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[185,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[991,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[286,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[888,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[887,"`aria-valuenow` reflects the current value"],[285,"`aria-valuenow` reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"],[889,"`aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`)"],[287,"`aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`) via `Intl.NumberFormat`; the same string is rendered inside the circle. Override the text with the `aria-valuetext` prop, or control formatting with `formatOptions`"],[1852,"`Box` is a polymorphic layout component that renders as any HTML element or custom component via the `as` prop. It provides consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment within flex or grid containers."],[90,"`Calendar` values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"],[170,"`CheckboxGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."],[240,"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"],[258,"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete