ated dates on one axis, thousands separators on the other. The functions receive the raw accessor value, so they also cover currency, units, or percentages."],[1804,"`xTickFormat` and `yTickFormat` shape the axis labels - dates, currency, units, percentages - and the tooltip follows the same formatting."],[1801,"`xTickMarks` and `yTickMarks` draw the short lines at each tick value, which helps tie a label to its exact position on the axis."],[1799,"`xTitle` and `yTitle` label what each axis actually measures, e.g. \"Month\" and \"Temperature (°F)\"."],[1809,"`xZero` and `yZero` stretch the domain to include zero. Worth doing when the absolute size of the values matters, not just their movement."],[1694,"✅ Custom domains"],[1695,"✅ Design system alignment"],[1252,"✅ For binary on/off preferences (e.g. Wi-Fi, notifications, dark mode)"],[1506,"✅ For compact action grouping — related actions in space-constrained layouts (e.g. Undo / Redo, Zoom In / Out / Reset)"],[1505,"✅ For grouped contextual actions — two or more closely related actions that belong together (e.g. Bold / Italic / Underline, Align Left / Center / Right)"],[1507,"✅ For multi-select scenarios — when users need to select multiple options simultaneously"],[189,"✅ For selecting multiple independent options"],[1251,"✅ For settings that take effect immediately, without a form submission"],[191,"✅ For toggling settings or features on/off"],[1693,"✅ Interactive tooltips"],[1692,"✅ Responsive behavior with sticky axes"],[1690,"✅ Single and multi-series support"],[1691,"✅ Vertical and horizontal orientations"],[192,"✅ When all available options should be visible"],[994,"✅ When all options should be visible at once"],[995,"✅ When the decision is important and deserves space"],[993,"✅ When there are 2-7 mutually exclusive options"],[190,"✅ When users can select zero, one, or many items"],[997,"❌ For binary yes/no choices (use Checkbox or Toggle instead)"],[1254,"❌ For choosing one of several mutually exclusive opt